sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Run Worker
    participant D as SQLite
    participant L as Lifecycle Worker
    participant V as Result Validator
    participant T as Turn Queue
    participant F as Frontend

    W->>D: atomic terminal Run plus outcome plus completion job
    D-->>L: lease completion job
    L->>V: validate and materialize Result from outcome
    V-->>L: immutable Result or no publishable Result
    L->>D: revalidate scope and commit Result task state and events
    alt no newer user message and no active Turn
        L->>D: compare and set active Turn plus auto reply operation key
        D->>T: enqueue new internal presentation Turn
        L->>D: append auto_reply_queued event
    else no newer user message but a Turn is active
        L->>D: keep presentation pending for terminal Turn rescheduling
    else newer user message or invalid scope
        L->>D: append auto_reply_skipped event with safe reason
    end
    D-->>F: ordered Conversation events from sequence cursor
    Note over D,L: Replayed completion jobs converge on one Result and at most one presentation Turn.
